[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我看看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨给我后，应该收在这边了才是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有了有了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这件衣服是什么尺寸啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边照着镜子，一边测量尺寸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对我来说当然是太小了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥的话，嗯，应该没问题。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哥、哥哥……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我还纳闷……为什么哥哥房间会有女生校服呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“一切谜题都解开了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的。而且这尺寸我也穿不下啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15558"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“真相只有一个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，都说不是了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15542"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“赌上外婆的名号！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15389"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你这可恶的混蛋！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等一下，羽未，你混了很多台词但是最后那句一毛钱关系都没有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“听我说。这件校服是要给我朋友的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“朋友？……同好吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“首先你对我的爱好理解有误。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只是普通的女性朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……女朋友？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“并不是。”"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]